                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 19.</seg></opener>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">San Rogue</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1862-12-23"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 23, 1862—2.45<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Sumter flying British flag. Is loading. Probably be conveyed (convoyed?) to sea
                    if necessary.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>SPRAGUE.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adams</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">American
                            Minister, London.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
